        "title": "The Riemann Hypothesis",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Known (unconditionally):\n  All non-trivial zeros satisfy 0 < Re(s) < 1  (proven by Hadamard)\n  ζ(s) ≠ 0 on Re(s) = 1 (proven by Hadamard and de la Vallée Poussin — used to prove PNT)\n  ζ(1/2 + it) = 0 for the first zero at t ≈ 14.134725..."
    },
