      "text": "```\nEXPLICIT FORMULA (Riemann, 1859):\n  ψ(x) = Σ_{n≤x} Λ(n) = x - Σ_ρ x^ρ/ρ - ln(2π) + small"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-RIEMANN-HYPOTHESIS.md#014",
      "path": [
