      "text": "IF RH (all ρ = 1/2 + it):\n  Each x^ρ = x^{1/2+it} = x^{1/2} · e^{it ln x}\n  Amplitude: |x^ρ/ρ| = x^{1/2}/|ρ|"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-RIEMANN-HYPOTHESIS.md#016",
      "path": [
        "08-RIEMANN-HYPOTHESIS.md"
      ],
